cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the original BESTPRED (Cole and VanRaden, 2008)."
type: software
title: "bestpred: USDA best prediction of dairy lactation yields, ported to Python"
abstract: >-
  Python translation of USDA-AGIL's BESTPRED 2.0rc7. Takes a cow's test days and returns 305-day, 365-day and
  to-date milk, fat, protein and SCS (actual and mature equivalent), persistency, reliabilities and the daily
  lactation curve. Checked against the original Fortran to 1e-9 relative on every output.
authors:
